<title>UK: BGL sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond due Dec 2005.</title>
<headline>BGL sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond due Dec 2005.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager Banque Generale du Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE GENERALE DU LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    29.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.70    PAY DATE   L29.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  LUX	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME. LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
